<script setup lang="ts">
// B2 产品成本详情 + B4 同产品差额对照。规格 unified-spec/B-cost-analysis.md §B2/§B4。两个工作区共用。
import {computed} from 'vue'
import UButton from '@nuxt/ui/components/Button.vue'
import UBadge from '@nuxt/ui/components/Badge.vue'
import UCard from '@nuxt/ui/components/Card.vue'
import {productAdopted,supersededText,compareCells,adoptedUnit,stageLabel,productReview,pairDelta,gapOf,fmtCost as fmt,fmtPct,moneyUnit,stateLabel,unitCost,type CostProduct,type CostOrder,type CostWorkspaceConfig} from './cost-review'
type Section='material'|'labor'|'evidence'
const props=defineProps<{product:CostProduct;config:CostWorkspaceConfig;batchFilter?:"all"|"ready"|"missing";pair?:string[];allOrders?:CostOrder[];cmp?:string[]}>()
const emit=defineEmits<{"update:cmp":[value:string[]];"update:batchFilter":[value:"all"|"ready"|"missing"];"update:pair":[value:string[]];back:[];gaps:[];inspect:[order:CostOrder,section?:Section];analyze:[];supplement:[order:CostOrder]}>()
const review=computed(()=>productReview(props.product)),currency=computed(()=>moneyUnit(props.product.currency))
const orderFilter=computed({get:()=>props.batchFilter||'all',set:(value:'all'|'ready'|'missing')=>emit('update:batchFilter',value)})
const rows=computed(()=>props.product.orders.filter(o=>orderFilter.value==='all'||orderFilter.value==='ready'&&unitCost(o)!==null||orderFilter.value==='missing'&&gapOf(o)!==null))
// 对照单：默认最高与最低；用户可换，存在工作区偏好里
const pairIds=computed(()=>{const ids=(props.pair||[]).filter(id=>review.value.eligible.some(o=>o.id===id));return ids.length===2&&ids[0]!==ids[1]?ids:[review.value.higher?.id,review.value.lower?.id].filter(Boolean) as string[]})
const pairOrders=computed(()=>{const [a,b]=pairIds.value.map(id=>review.value.eligible.find(o=>o.id===id)!);if(!a||!b)return null;return unitCost(a)!>=unitCost(b)!?{high:a,low:b}:{high:b,low:a}})
const delta=computed(()=>pairOrders.value?pairDelta(pairOrders.value.high,pairOrders.value.low):null)
function choosePair(index:0|1,id:string){const next=[...pairIds.value];next[index]=id;emit('update:pair',next)}
// 第五批①：任选两张工单并排（同产品在前，其他产品单列并提示仅供参考）
const others=computed(()=>(props.allOrders||[]).filter(o=>!props.product.orders.some(x=>x.id===o.id)))
const cmpIds=computed(()=>{const ids=(props.cmp||[]).filter(id=>props.product.orders.some(o=>o.id===id)||others.value.some(o=>o.id===id));const own=props.product.orders;const a=ids[0]||own[0]?.id;return [a,ids[1]&&ids[1]!==a?ids[1]:own.find(o=>o.id!==a)?.id||''] as string[]})
const findOrder=(id:string)=>props.product.orders.find(o=>o.id===id)||others.value.find(o=>o.id===id)
const cmpA=computed(()=>cmpIds.value[0]?findOrder(cmpIds.value[0]):undefined),cmpB=computed(()=>cmpIds.value[1]?findOrder(cmpIds.value[1]):undefined)
const cmpRows=computed(()=>{if(!cmpA.value||!cmpB.value)return [];const a=compareCells(cmpA.value),b=compareCells(cmpB.value),sameUnit=(a.unit||'')===(b.unit||''),d=(x:number|null,y:number|null)=>x===null||y===null?null:x-y
 return [{label:'材料',a:a.material,b:b.material,delta:d(a.material.value,b.material.value)},{label:'人工',a:a.labor,b:b.labor,delta:d(a.labor.value,b.labor.value)},{label:'委外 / 其他',a:a.extra,b:b.extra,delta:d(a.extra.value,b.extra.value)},{label:'合计',a:a.total,b:b.total,delta:d(a.total.value,b.total.value)},{label:'产出（'+(a.unit||'—')+' / '+(b.unit||'—')+'）',a:a.output,b:b.output,delta:sameUnit?d(a.output.value,b.output.value):null,why:sameUnit?null:'单位不同，不比较'},{label:'单位成本',a:a.unitCost,b:b.unitCost,delta:sameUnit?d(a.unitCost.value,b.unitCost.value):null,why:sameUnit?null:'单位不同，不比较'}]})
const crossProduct=computed(()=>!!cmpA.value&&!!cmpB.value&&(!props.product.orders.includes(cmpA.value)||!props.product.orders.includes(cmpB.value)))
function chooseCmp(i:0|1,id:string){const n=[...cmpIds.value];n[i]=id;emit('update:cmp',n)}
const pm=computed(()=>productAdopted(props.product,'material')),pl=computed(()=>productAdopted(props.product,'labor')),supText=computed(()=>supersededText(props.product.supersededSupplements))
const pairSup=computed(()=>pairOrders.value?[pairOrders.value.high,pairOrders.value.low].filter(o=>o.blacklake?.supersededFields?.length).map(o=>o.projectCode+'（'+o.blacklake!.supersededFields!.join('、')+'）'):[])
const pairWeigh=computed(()=>pairOrders.value?[pairOrders.value.high,pairOrders.value.low].filter(o=>o.weigh?.complete).map(o=>o.projectCode+' 每 kg '+fmt(o.weigh!.unitCost)+'（÷ 完工良品 '+fmt(o.weigh!.goodKg)+' kg）'):[])
const firstChecks=computed(()=>review.value.checks.slice(0,3))
</script>
<template>
 <section class="nuxt-product-review" aria-label="产品成本详情">
  <nav class="nuxt-cost-breadcrumb" aria-label="成本下钻路径"><span>数据与分析</span><span>/</span><span>成本分析</span><span>/</span><UButton label="产品汇总" color="neutral" variant="ghost" size="xs" @click="emit('back')"/><span>/</span><strong>{{product.product}}</strong><small>{{product.productCode||'编码待核对'}} · #{{product.productTypeId.slice(-8)}}</small></nav>
  <UCard class="nuxt-review-card"><template #header><div class="nuxt-cost-heading"><div><h2>{{product.product}}</h2><p>{{config.label}} · {{stageLabel(product.stage)}} · {{product.unit||'单位待核对'}} · {{config.currencyNote}} · 可比较 {{review.eligible.length}} / {{product.orderCount}} 张{{config.orderTerm}}</p></div><div class="nuxt-demo-row"><UButton label="解读这个产品" color="neutral" variant="outline" @click="emit('analyze')"/><span class="cost-help" tabindex="0" title="把本产品交给右下角悬浮窗：解释平均成本和工单差额、列出待核对项。不改金额，不保存。" aria-label="解读这个产品的说明">?</span></div></div></template>
   <div class="nuxt-review-metrics"><div><span>平均单位直接成本 · Cretas 计算</span><strong>{{fmt(product.weightedUnitCost)}}<small>{{currency}} / {{product.unit||'单位待核对'}}</small></strong></div><div><span>已记录产出</span><strong>{{fmt(product.knownOutput)}}<small>{{product.unit}}<template v-if="product.outputPartial"> · 部分记录</template></small></strong></div><div><span>材料费 · 采用值</span><strong>{{fmt(pm.value)}}<small>{{currency}}<template v-if="pm.partial"> · 部分记录</template> · {{pm.src}}</small></strong></div><div><span>人工费 · 采用值</span><strong>{{fmt(pl.value)}}<small>{{currency}}<template v-if="pl.partial"> · 部分记录</template> · {{pl.src}}</small></strong></div></div>
   <p v-if="product.weighAgg?.count||product.weighAgg?.pending" class="cost-supp-note" aria-label="按良品重量">按良品重量（Cretas 称重 {{product.weighAgg.count}} 张，良品 {{fmt(product.weighAgg.goodKg)}} kg<template v-if="product.weighAgg.byproductKg">，副产品 {{fmt(product.weighAgg.byproductKg)}} kg</template>）：每 kg 直接成本 <b>{{fmt(product.weighAgg.unitCost)}}</b> {{currency}}，其中材料 {{fmt(product.weighAgg.materialUnit)}}<template v-if="product.weighAgg.pending">；另有 {{product.weighAgg.pending}} 张完工工序未称重，未计入</template><template v-if="product.weighAgg.costed<product.weighAgg.count">；{{product.weighAgg.count-product.weighAgg.costed}} 张称重单金额不能计算，未计入</template>。</p>
   <p v-if="supText" class="cost-supp-note cost-warn-text" aria-label="已被取代的补充">{{supText}}<template v-if="review.eligible.some(o=>o.blacklake?.supersededFields?.length)">平均单位直接成本<template v-if="review.eligible.length>1">和下方「差额记在哪里」</template>是 Cretas 计算口径，仍含这笔补充；</template>采用值见下方「两张工单对照」。</p>
   <div class="nuxt-review-summary"><strong>结论</strong>
    <p v-if="product.weightedUnitCost!==null">可比较的 {{review.eligible.length}} 张，每{{product.unit}}已识别直接成本 {{fmt(product.weightedUnitCost)}} {{currency}}：材料 {{fmt(product.weightedMaterialUnitCost)}}（{{fmtPct(product.weightedMaterialUnitCost!/product.weightedUnitCost)}}）、人工 {{fmt(product.weightedLaborUnitCost)}}（{{fmtPct(product.weightedLaborUnitCost!/product.weightedUnitCost)}}）。</p>
    <p v-else>当前没有可计算单位成本的{{config.orderTerm}}。先补齐下方明确缺失的资料；已记录零值保留。</p>
    <p v-if="review.eligible.length===1">只有 1 张可比较，暂不能判断工单之间的成本差异。</p>
    <p v-if="review.missing.length">另有 {{review.missing.length}} 张暂不能算单位成本（先核资料）；资料缺口不等于成本异常。</p><p v-if="review.rosterOnly.length" class="nuxt-muted">{{review.rosterOnly.length}} 张只缺实际参与名单或人时：单位成本不受影响，人均和工序分摊暂不能算。</p>
    <details><summary>计算范围与依据</summary><p>平均单位成本＝同一产品、阶段、币种、单位下，可比较工单的材料费与人工费合计 ÷ 对应良品合计（不是各单单价的平均）。不含制造费用，不推算完整制造成本或利润。</p></details></div>
   <div v-if="product.weightedUnitCost!==null&&product.weightedUnitCost>0" class="nuxt-product-composition" aria-label="产品单位成本构成"><div><span>材料</span><strong>{{fmt(product.weightedMaterialUnitCost)}} {{currency}}/{{product.unit}}</strong></div><div class="nuxt-review-stack"><span :style="{width:product.weightedMaterialUnitCost!/product.weightedUnitCost*100+'%'}"/><span :style="{width:product.weightedLaborUnitCost!/product.weightedUnitCost*100+'%'}"/></div><div><span>人工</span><strong>{{fmt(product.weightedLaborUnitCost)}} {{currency}}/{{product.unit}}</strong></div></div>
  </UCard>
  <UCard v-if="review.eligible.length>1&&pairOrders&&delta" class="nuxt-review-card" aria-label="同产品工单差额"><template #header><div class="nuxt-cost-heading"><h3>差额记在哪里</h3><div class="nuxt-demo-row cost-pair"><label>对照单 A<select :value="pairIds[0]" aria-label="对照单A" @change="choosePair(0,($event.target as HTMLSelectElement).value)"><option v-for="o in review.ordered" :key="o.id" :value="o.id">{{o.projectCode}} · {{fmt(unitCost(o))}}</option></select></label><label>对照单 B<select :value="pairIds[1]" aria-label="对照单B" @change="choosePair(1,($event.target as HTMLSelectElement).value)"><option v-for="o in review.ordered" :key="o.id" :value="o.id">{{o.projectCode}} · {{fmt(unitCost(o))}}</option></select></label></div></div></template>
   <p class="nuxt-muted">本表按黑湖报工良品算（Cretas 计算口径，每{{product.unit}}），不含称重采用值。<template v-if="pairWeigh.length">有 Cretas 称重的单，按完工良品算的采用值：{{pairWeigh.join('；')}}。</template><template v-if="pairSup.length">{{pairSup.join('、')}} 的 Cretas 值含已被黑湖来源值取代的补充，采用值见上方「两张工单对照」。</template></p>
   <p v-if="delta.warn.length" class="nuxt-review-summary cost-warn" role="note">对照单 {{delta.warn.join('、')}} 有零工资或资料待核，这个差额不能用于判断，先核对资料。</p>
   <div class="nuxt-cost-scroll"><table class="nuxt-cost-table cost-delta"><thead><tr><th>项目（每{{product.unit}}）</th><th>{{pairOrders.high.projectCode}}（较高）</th><th>{{pairOrders.low.projectCode}}（较低）</th><th>差额</th><th>操作</th></tr></thead><tbody>
    <tr><td>材料</td><td>{{fmt(pairOrders.high.materialCost!/pairOrders.high.finishedGood!)}}</td><td>{{fmt(pairOrders.low.materialCost!/pairOrders.low.finishedGood!)}}</td><td><b>{{fmt(delta.material)}}</b></td><td><UButton label="核对" size="xs" color="neutral" variant="ghost" @click="emit('inspect',pairOrders.high,'material')"/></td></tr>
    <tr><td>人工</td><td>{{fmt(pairOrders.high.laborCost!/pairOrders.high.finishedGood!)}}</td><td>{{fmt(pairOrders.low.laborCost!/pairOrders.low.finishedGood!)}}</td><td><b>{{fmt(delta.labor)}}</b></td><td><UButton label="核对" size="xs" color="neutral" variant="ghost" @click="emit('inspect',pairOrders.high,'labor')"/></td></tr>
    <tr class="cost-total"><td>合计</td><td>{{fmt(unitCost(pairOrders.high))}}</td><td>{{fmt(unitCost(pairOrders.low))}}</td><td><b>{{fmt(delta.total)}}</b> {{currency}}<small v-if="!delta.balanced">拆分校验未通过</small></td><td><UButton label="看较低" size="xs" color="neutral" variant="ghost" @click="emit('inspect',pairOrders.low,'material')"/></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
   <details><summary>材料差在哪几种（只比两边都有行成本的物料）</summary><div class="nuxt-cost-scroll"><table class="nuxt-cost-table"><thead><tr><th>物料</th><th>较高 / 单位</th><th>较低 / 单位</th><th>差额</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="m in delta.materials" :key="m.name+m.unit"><td>{{m.name}}<small>{{m.unit||'单位待核对'}}</small></td><td>{{fmt(m.highUnit)}}</td><td>{{fmt(m.lowUnit)}}</td><td>{{m.delta===null?'无法对照':fmt(m.delta)}}</td></tr><tr v-if="!delta.materials.length"><td colspan="4">两张单都没有逐料行成本，无法对照。</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details>
   <details><summary>人工差在哪几道工序（只比人时已知的）</summary><table class="nuxt-cost-table"><thead><tr><th>工序</th><th>较高 / 单位</th><th>较低 / 单位</th><th>差额</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="p in delta.processes" :key="p.name"><td>{{p.name}}</td><td>{{fmt(p.highUnit)}}</td><td>{{fmt(p.lowUnit)}}</td><td>{{p.delta===null?'无法对照':fmt(p.delta)}}</td></tr><tr v-if="!delta.processes.length"><td colspan="4">没有可对照的工序分摊。</td></tr></tbody></table></details>
   <p class="nuxt-muted">这是账面差额，不能据此断言成本上涨、浪费或已查明原因。可能原因（用量、组合、退料、历史估值、规格）均待核对。</p>
  </UCard>
  <UCard class="nuxt-review-card" aria-label="两张工单对照"><template #header><div class="nuxt-cost-heading"><div><h3>两张工单对照</h3><p class="nuxt-muted">有黑湖成本的取采用值（黑湖非 0 优先，黑湖记为 0 按 Cretas，黑湖为负不计算），否则取 Cretas 计算；每格标来源。</p></div><div class="nuxt-demo-row cost-pair"><label v-for="(lbl,i) in ['A','B']" :key="lbl">工单 {{lbl}}<select :value="cmpIds[i]" :aria-label="'对照工单'+lbl" @change="chooseCmp(i as 0|1,($event.target as HTMLSelectElement).value)"><option v-if="!cmpIds[i]" value="" disabled>请选择工单</option><optgroup :label="'本产品 · '+product.product"><option v-for="o in product.orders" :key="o.id" :value="o.id">{{o.projectCode}}</option></optgroup><optgroup v-if="others.length" label="其他产品（仅供参考）"><option v-for="o in others" :key="o.id" :value="o.id">{{o.projectCode}} · {{o.product}}</option></optgroup></select></label></div></div></template>
   <p v-if="crossProduct" class="nuxt-review-summary cost-warn">两张单不是同一产品，差额只供参考，不能说明成本高低的原因。</p>
   <div v-if="cmpA&&cmpB" class="nuxt-cost-scroll"><table class="nuxt-cost-table"><thead><tr><th>项目</th><th>{{cmpA.projectCode}}</th><th>{{cmpB.projectCode}}</th><th>差额（A−B）</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="r in cmpRows" :key="r.label" :class="{'cost-total':r.label==='合计'||r.label==='单位成本'}"><td>{{r.label}}</td><td>{{fmt(r.a.value)}}<small>{{r.a.source}}<template v-if="r.a.note"> · {{r.a.note}}</template></small></td><td>{{fmt(r.b.value)}}<small>{{r.b.source}}<template v-if="r.b.note"> · {{r.b.note}}</template></small></td><td>{{r.why?'—':fmt(r.delta)}}<small v-if="r.why">{{r.why}}</small><small v-else-if="r.delta===null">{{r.a.value===null&&r.b.value===null?'两边都没有读数':'有一边不能计算'}}</small></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
   <p v-else-if="cmpA" class="nuxt-review-summary" role="note">本产品只有 1 张工单（{{cmpA.projectCode}}），<template v-if="others.length">请在「工单 B」里从其他产品选一张作参考；不同产品的差额只供参考。</template><template v-else>当前筛选范围里没有其他产品的工单；清除上方筛选后，可在「工单 B」里选其他产品的工单作参考。</template></p>
   <div v-if="cmpA&&cmpB" class="nuxt-demo-row"><UButton label="看 A" size="xs" color="neutral" variant="ghost" @click="emit('inspect',cmpA)"/><UButton label="看 B" size="xs" color="neutral" variant="ghost" @click="emit('inspect',cmpB)"/></div>
  </UCard>
  <UCard v-if="review.checks.length" class="nuxt-review-card"><template #header><div class="nuxt-cost-heading"><h3>先核对什么</h3><div class="nuxt-demo-row"><UBadge :color="review.missing.length?'warning':'neutral'" variant="subtle">{{review.missing.length}} 张不能算 · {{review.rosterOnly.length}} 张只缺名单</UBadge><UButton v-if="review.checks.length>3" label="全部待补资料" size="xs" color="neutral" variant="ghost" @click="emit('gaps')"/></div></div></template>
   <div v-for="o in firstChecks" :key="o.id" class="nuxt-review-action"><div><strong>{{o.projectCode}}</strong><p>{{gapOf(o)!.label}}：{{gapOf(o)!.reasons.join('；')}}</p><small>找 {{gapOf(o)!.owner}} · 补齐后：{{gapOf(o)!.unlocks}}</small></div><UButton label="核对" color="neutral" variant="outline" size="xs" @click="emit('inspect',o,'evidence')"/></div></UCard>
  <UCard class="nuxt-review-card"><template #header><div class="nuxt-cost-heading"><h3>相关{{config.orderTerm}}</h3><label>范围<select v-model="orderFilter" aria-label="产品工单范围"><option value="all">全部</option><option value="ready">单位成本可比较</option><option value="missing">资料或口径待核</option></select></label></div></template>
   <div class="nuxt-cost-scroll"><table class="nuxt-cost-table"><thead><tr><th>工单 / 来源</th><th>状态</th><th>良品产出</th><th>单位直接成本 / 来源</th><th>需要关注</th><th>操作</th></tr></thead><tbody>
    <tr v-for="o in rows" :key="o.id"><td><button class="nuxt-cost-link" @click="emit('inspect',o)">{{o.projectCode}}</button><small v-if="o.planNumber!==o.projectCode">{{o.planNumber||'未关联计划'}}</small></td><td><UBadge color="neutral" variant="subtle">{{stateLabel(o.status)}}</UBadge><small v-if="o.synthetic">模拟批次</small></td><td>{{fmt(o.finishedGood)}} {{o.unit}}</td><td>{{fmt(adoptedUnit(o).value)}}<small>{{adoptedUnit(o).reason||adoptedUnit(o).label+' · '+currency+' / '+(o.unit||'单位待核对')}}</small></td><td>{{gapOf(o)?.label||'直接成本可用'}}</td><td class="cost-row-actions"><UButton label="补充" color="neutral" variant="ghost" size="xs" :disabled="!o.processes.length" :title="o.processes.length?'补充本工单人工资料':'无工序对应，先回来源核对报工'" @click="emit('supplement',o)"/><a v-if="config.sourceLink('plan',o)" class="nuxt-cost-link" :href="config.sourceLink('plan',o)!">来源</a></td></tr>
    <tr v-if="!rows.length"><td colspan="6">此条件下没有工单</td></tr></tbody></table></div></UCard>
  <UCard class="nuxt-review-card"><template #header><h3>材料与人工依据</h3></template>
   <details><summary>材料 · 领退料 {{review.trace.length}} 行</summary><p class="nuxt-muted">按来源去重；已发、实耗、退回各取原记录，不按 BOM 理论量估算材料费。</p><div class="nuxt-cost-scroll"><table class="nuxt-cost-table"><thead><tr><th>领料单 / 物料</th><th>状态</th><th>需求</th><th>已发</th><th>实耗</th><th>退回</th><th>行成本</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="t in review.trace" :key="t.id"><td>{{t.document}}<small>{{t.material}}</small></td><td>{{stateLabel(t.status)}}</td><td>{{fmt(t.required)}} {{t.unit}}</td><td>{{fmt(t.issued)}} {{t.unit}}</td><td>{{fmt(t.consumed)}} {{t.unit}}</td><td>{{fmt(t.returned)}} {{t.unit}}</td><td>{{fmt(t.recordedLineCost)}}</td></tr><tr v-if="!review.trace.length"><td colspan="7">没有可关联的领退料行，不推测材料构成。</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details>
   <details><summary>人工 · 按工单分组的工序分摊与人均</summary><p class="nuxt-muted">人数按本单实际名单去重，跨单不相加；分摊属于同一笔人工费，不再计入一次。</p><div class="nuxt-cost-scroll"><table class="nuxt-cost-table"><thead><tr><th>工单 / 工序</th><th>有效人时</th><th>人工分摊</th><th>人工占比</th></tr></thead><tbody><template v-for="o in product.orders" :key="o.id"><tr class="cost-group-row"><td><b>{{o.projectCode}}</b></td><td colspan="3">人工 {{fmt(o.laborCost)}} {{currency}} · 实际参与 {{o.participants===null?'未提供':o.participants+' 人'}} · 人均 {{fmt(o.perPerson)}}</td></tr><tr v-for="p in o.processes" :key="o.id+p.id"><td>　{{p.name}}</td><td>{{fmt(p.personHours)}}</td><td>{{fmt(p.allocatedLabor)}} {{currency}}</td><td>{{o.laborCost&&p.allocatedLabor!==null?fmtPct(p.allocatedLabor/o.laborCost):'—'}}</td></tr></template></tbody></table></div></details></UCard>
 </section>
